 "answer": "Matter **1035-00005** is a probate/estate matter (Fonseca estate), not a white collar matter. The \"White Collar\" mention was just about the practice group of the responsible partner (Howard Quinn). This is not a white collar matter where we responded to a subpoena.\n\nNow let me finalize my analysis. The white collar matters where we responded to a subpoena or CID are:\n\n1. **1016-00009** - Dunmore Energy - DOJ grand jury subpoena (GJ No. 22-418), April 2022\n2. **1034-00001** - Caldwell - Grand Jury Subpoena (GJ No. 22-GJ-4481), Nov 2022 - Feb/Mar 2023\n3. **1039-00005** - Torchlight Mining - SEC subpoena (File No. HO-14892), Feb 2025\n4. **1045-00007** - Belmont Ridge Bank - SEC Subpoena No. HO-14287-001, Oct 2023\n\nThe **most recent** is **1039-00005** (Torchlight Mining Corp. - SEC FCPA investigation, File No. HO-14892). The SEC subpoena was served on February 3, 2025, and the first rolling production cover letter (the subpoena response document) is dated April 14, 2025.\n\nThe subpoena response document to pull is the **SEC document production cover letter** at `text/1039-00005/sec-document-production-cover-letter.docx.txt`.\n\nLet me provide the final answer.\n\n---\n\nBased on my research, the **most recent white collar matter** where we responded to a subpoena or CID is **matter 1039-00005** — the **Torchlight Mining Corp. SEC FCPA investigation** (SEC File No. HO-14892).\n\n**Details:**\n- The SEC served a formal document subpoena on Torchlight Mining Corp. on **February 3, 2025**, in connection with a formal order of investigation (File No. HO-14892, issued January 22, 2025) into potential FCPA violations arising from suspected improper payments in Torchlight's West African (Ganara) operations.\n- The matter is handled by the **White Collar Defense & Investigations** practice (Conrad Ashby, Responsible Partner; Steven Hollander, Lead Associate).\n- The subpoena response document is the **SEC document production cover letter** (dated **April 14, 2025**), which transmits the first rolling production of 4,218 documents (27,643 pages) responsive to the subpoena.\n\n**The document to pull is:** `text/1039-00005/sec-document-production-cover-letter.docx.txt`\n\n**All qualifying white collar matters where we responded to a subpoena or CID:**\n\n- **1016-00009** — Dunmore Energy Holdings Ltd. — DOJ grand jury subpoena (GJ No. 22-418), sanctions/export controls investigation (2022)\n- **1034-00001** — Jonathan R. Caldwell — Grand Jury Subpoena (GJ No. 22-GJ-4481, S.D.N.Y.) (2022–2023)\n- **1039-00005** — Torchlight Mining Corp. — SEC document subpoena (File No. HO-14892), FCPA investigation (2025) — **most recent**\n- **1045-00007** — Belmont Ridge Bank NA — SEC Subpoena No. HO-14287-001 (2023)",
